><p>This research was supported in part by grants NSC86-2314-B010-123T and NSC87-2314-B010-103 from the National Science  Council, and also by a grant DOH88-HR-813 from National Health Research Institutes, Taiwan, ROC.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>